  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Livelihoods &amp; Improving Incomes for Rice Farmers Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FABRAR purchases locally grown rice from farmers before processing the rice at a standard acceptable to all buyers. FABRAR also works with the farmers to increase their production of paddy rice. Currently, the company operates within Margibi County and buys rice from farmers in the area surrounding Kakata. FABRAR needs additional rice milling equipment, capital and technical assistance to be able to purchase and process more rice from the local farmers and obtain a higher value and additional customers for the processed rice it sells.</narrative>
  </description>
